~Version
 VERS.                  2.0: CWLS LAS version
 WRAP.                   NO: One line per depth step
~Well
 STRT.M              1810.0: Start measured depth
 STOP.M              2310.0: Stop measured depth
 STEP.M                2.5: Step
 NULL.             -999.25: Null value
 WELL.          GW-DEMO-02: Well name
 FLD .          GEOWORLD-DEMO: Field
~Curve
 DEPT.M        : Measured depth
 VP.M/S      : Compressional velocity
 VS.M/S      : Shear velocity
 RHOB.G/C3     : Bulk density
 GR.API      : Gamma ray
 RESD.OHMM     : Deep resistivity
 SW.V/V      : Water saturation
 PHIE.V/V      : Effective porosity
 NPHI.V/V      : Neutron porosity proxy
 DT.US/M     : Compressional slowness derived from VP
 DTS.US/M     : Shear slowness derived from VS
~Parameter
 NOTE. Synthetic layered shale-sand-shale-sand-shale demo: not field data
 L01.1810.0-1865.0 : Upper Seal; marine shale; thickness 55.0 m
