 L03.1970.0-2050.0 : Baffle Shale; silty shale; thickness 80.0 m
 L04.2050.0-2115.0 : Reservoir B; lower porosity cemented sand; thickness 65.0 m
 L05.2115.0-2310.0 : Lower Seal; compacted shale; thickness 195.0 m
